<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Houston Exploration started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Houston Exploration started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said analyst Alvina Lee started coverage Wednesday of Houston Exploration Co with a rating of near- and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed Tuesday at 12-1/2.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
